  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "    SCC DEPARTMENT OF STARSHIP DEVELOPMENT ANNOUNCED THE NEXT GENERATION
    OF WARP DRIVE TECHNOLOGY TODAY AT AN UNVEILING CEREMONY AT HOME BASE. SCC DIRECTOR
    WALTER GILROY JOINED THE PRESENTATION AND SPOKE TO THE CROWD IN ATTENDANCE.\n   
    \"DEEP SPACE TRAVEL WOULD NOT BE POSSIBLE WITHOUT WARP DRIVE. THE IMPROVEMENTS
    MADE BY OUR RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT TEAM HAVE YIELDED A NEW WARP CORE CAPABLE
    OF GOING TWICE AS FAST AS BEFORE WHILE ONLY USING HALF THE ENERGY. THE PRIDE
    I HAVE IN OUR TEAM OF ENGINEERS CANNOT BE OVERSTATED, AND I AM ANXIOUSLY AWAITING
    THE REFIT OF OUR ENTIRE FLEET TO INCORPORATE THIS ONCE-IN-A-CENTURY ADVANCEMENT.\" "
