  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "    \"UNFORTUNATELY, WE WILL NO LONGER DEDICATE SCC RESOURCES TOWARDS
    HUNTING THEM DOWN. OUR MODELS INDICATE THE LIKELIHOOD THAT SCC-3002 IS STILL
    INTACT WITH ITS CREW ALIVE IS BELOW A 2% PROBABILITY. THESE VESSELS WERE DESIGNED
    TO BE OPERATED BY CREWS OF AT LEAST 20, NOT ONE FIFTH OF THAT NUMBER.\"\n   
    GILROY, THE PRIMARY ADVOCATE FOR THE HUMAN CREW REPLACEMENT PROGRAM (HCRP), HAS
    CITED THE INCIDENT AS ONE OF HIS REASONS FOR FURTHER IMPROVING SHIP AUTOMATION
    CAPABILITIES. "
