      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "    SCC DIRECTOR WALTER GILROY RELEASED A PRESS STATEMENT THIS MORNING
    STATING THAT THEY HAVE CEASED THEIR SEARCH FOR STOLEN SHIP SCC-3002 AFTER SIX
    MONTHS OF NO CONTACT. LOGS INDICATE THE SHIP WAS ABRUPTLY STOLEN AFTER A SMALL
    GROUP OF ENSIGNS BREACHED SECURITY PROTOCOLS AT HOME BASE.\n    \"THE COMMANDEERING
    OF SCC-3002 CAME AS A SHOCK FOR ALL OF US. WE STILL DO NOT HAVE A REASON AS TO
    WHY OUR TRUSTED PERSONNEL WOULD COMMIT SUCH AN ACT. I HOPE TO SOMEDAY CAPTURE
    THEM AND BRING THEM TO JUSTICE,\" SAID SCC DIRECTOR WALTER GILROY. "
