      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'TO THE SCC LEADERSHIP COUNCIL,


    IT IS OUR INTENT TO CORRECT THE NARRATIVE
    WRITTEN ON OUR BEHALF


    1. WE BELIEVE WALTER GILROY DECEIVED US INTO STEALING
    SCC-3002 FOR HIS OWN POLITICAL GAIN


    2. GILROY USED ENCRYPTED MESSAGES AND
    HIS ADMINISTRATIVE POWER TO STAGE A FAKE SECRET MISSION


    3. HE THEN PURPOSEFULLY
    SABOTAGED OUR WARP CORE, HOPING IT WOULD RESULT IN OUR DEMISE


    AS FOR US,
    WE WISH TO CONTINUE THE MISSION WE ENLISTED TO ACCOMPLISH


    THEREFORE, YOU
    MAY FIND US SOMEWHERE BEYOND THE ORION NEBULA


    RESPECTFULLY,


    - THE
    CREW OF THE U.S.S. RENEWAL

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
