      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "    GILROY DISCUSSES THE THEFT OF SCC VESSEL SCC-3002 (U.S.S. RENEWAL).\n   
    \"FRANKLY, I WAS READY TO CALL IT QUITS. THE HCRP (HUMAN CREW REPLACEMENT PROGRAM)
    WAS DEAD IN THE WATER. I HAD NOTHING LEFT TO GIVE. BUT WHEN THAT SHIP WAS STOLEN--I
    KNEW IT WAS MY DUTY TO UNRETIRE, COME BACK, AND RIGHT THE SHIP THAT WAS WRONGED
    BY THOSE CRIMINALS. THERE'S NOTHING I WANT MORE THAN TO FIND THEM AND BRING THEM
    TO JUSTICE. BUT I MUST ADMIT, I DO FEEL VINDICATED KNOWING THAT I WAS RIGHT ABOUT
    THE UNRELIABLE NATURE OF HUMANS. THE HCRP FIXES THAT.\""
