  m_text: "    GILROY IS AWARE OF THE SCRUTINY REGARDING HIS ADMINISTRATIVE DECISIONS
    IN HIS TIME AS SCC DIRECTOR. \"I KNOW I'M NOT THE MOST POPULAR OFFICIAL TO ASSUME
    THIS SOUGHT-AFTER POSITION,\" HE SAID CANDIDLY IN AN INTERVIEW.\n    \"I RECEIVE
    MESSAGES DAILY. I HEAR THINGS DAILY. I ALWAYS AM SECOND-GUESSING MYSELF AND CHANGING
    PLANS. ARE THERE PEOPLE OUT THERE WHO WANT ME GONE? SURE. BUT I CAN ONLY DO WHAT
    I THINK IS RIGHT, WHETHER I'M 5 TRILLION MILES AWAY FROM EARTH OR 5 MINUTES.
    INTUITION IS MY SUPERPOWER,\" HE CONTINUES."
