  m_text: "    WARP DRIVE PROJECT \"CSS-497\" HAS BEEN IN DEVELOPMENT FOR THREE YEARS.
    IT UTILIZES THE SAME TECHNOLOGY AS PREVIOUS ITERATIONS BUT OPTIMIZES ENERGY USAGE
    AND IMPROVED MATTER REACTION PRECISION TO DRAMATICALLY IMPROVE EFFICIENCY.\n   
    \"THIS NEW WARP CORE, COMBINED WITH THE HCRP (HUMAN CREW REPLACEMENT PROGRAM),
    WILL TRANSFORM OUR FLEET FROM AN EFFECTIVE UNIT TO AN UNSTOPPABLE FORCE. THE
    FUTURE HAS NEVER BEEN BRIGHTER FOR OUR ORGANIZATION, AND FROM WHAT I'VE SEEN
    IN TESTING OF THIS WARP DRIVE, I MEAN THAT LITERALLY. THE BEST IS YET TO COME
    FOR HUMAN SPACE COLONIZATION,\" GILROY CONTINUED. "
