  m_text: "    GILROY CONTINUES: \"I KNEW THE PERPETRATORS OF THIS INCIDENT PERSONALLY.
    I WISH THEY HAD COME TO ME TO EXPRESS THEIR CONCERNS, DESIRES, OR MISALIGNED
    POINTS OF VIEW. INSTEAD, THEY WILL GO DOWN IN INFAMY AS THE MOST DESPICABLE REPRESENTATIVES
    OF OUR SPACEFARING ORGANIZATION. I THOUGHT I KNEW THEM, BUT IT IS VERY CLEAR
    THAT I DID NOT.\"\n    SINCE THE INCIDENT, UPGRADES TO SECURITY PROTOCOLS HAVE
    BEEN A PRIMARY FOCUS FOR HOME BASE ADMINISTRATION, INCLUDING INCREASED SURVEILLANCE
    AND MULTI-FACTOR AUTHORIZATION. "
